To add SoundCloud music playback to your website, follow these steps:

### 1. **Get a SoundCloud Track/Playlist Embed Code**
- Go to [SoundCloud](https://soundcloud.com), find the track or playlist you want to embed.
- Click the **Share** button → **Embed**.
- Copy the provided `<iframe>` code.

Example embed code:
```html
<iframe width="100%" height="166" scrolling="no" frameborder="no" allow="autoplay" src="https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/XXXXXXXXX&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true"></iframe>
```

---

### 2. **Add the Embed Code to Your Website**
Paste the `<iframe>` code directly into your HTML where you want the player to appear:
```html
<div id="soundcloud-player">
  <iframe width="100%" height="166" scrolling="no" frameborder="no" allow="autoplay"
    src="https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/XXXXXXXXX&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true">
  </iframe>
</div>
```

---

### 3. **Optional: Customize the Player**
#### Parameters to modify in the URL:
- `&auto_play=true`: Auto-play on load.
- `&hide_related=true`: Hide related tracks.
- `&show_comments=false`: Disable comments.
- `&color=ff0000`: Change accent color (hex without #).

[Full list of parameters](https://developers.soundcloud.com/docs/api/player).

---

### 4. **Advanced: Programmatic Control (JavaScript API)**
Use the [SC API](https://developers.soundcloud.com/docs/api/player) for play/pause controls:

#### Step 1: Include the API script
```html
<script src="https://w.soundcloud.com/player/api.js"></script>
```

#### Step 2: JavaScript example
```javascript
const iframe = document.querySelector('#soundcloud-player iframe');
const player = SC(iframe);

// Play when button clicked
document.getElementById('play-btn').addEventListener('click', () => {
  player.play();
});
document.getElementById('pause-btn').addEventListener('click', () => {
  player.pause();
});
```

---

### 5. **Responsive Design**
Make the player responsive with CSS:
```html
<div class="player-container">
  <iframe ...></iframe>
</div>
```
```css
.player-container {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 0;
  padding-bottom: 23%; /* Adjust ratio */
}
.player-container iframe {
  position: absolute;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  top: 0; left: 0;
}
```

Replace `XXXXXXXXX` in the URL with the actual SoundCloud **Track ID** or **Playlist URL**.

